  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39659748",
      "title": "Splitting Components By Feature & State",
      "sourceHash": "28789926eca7ef3446b0e518ffa759c4a3b48f3108cf2625f8e41c4092c7a66b",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.02,
          "end": 5.1,
          "en": "So let's now break up this big App Component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.1,
          "end": 7.86,
          "en": "And here I'd say it makes sense to put these",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.86,
          "end": 11.76,
          "en": "different sections into different new Components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.76,
          "end": 14.79,
          "en": "because in the end these are different features",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.79,
          "end": 17.13,
          "en": "of our demo App here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.13,
          "end": 19.32,
          "en": "This here is a feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.32,
          "end": 24.12,
          "en": "and this interactive area at the bottom is another feature.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.12,
          "end": 25.71,
          "en": "And putting different features",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.71,
          "end": 29.01,
          "en": "into different Components is always a good idea",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.01,
          "end": 30.93,
          "en": "in React projects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.93,
          "end": 33.27,
          "en": "Therefore, here in the Components folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.27,
          "end": 38.27,
          "en": "I'll start by creating a new core concepts JSX file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.37,
          "end": 41.583,
          "en": "that should store a new core concepts Component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.75,
          "end": 46.192,
          "en": "And I'll also add a new examples JSX file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.192,
          "end": 49.473,
          "en": "that should store this examples area here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 51.21,
          "end": 53.313,
          "en": "But I'll start with the core concepts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 54.36,
          "end": 59.1,
          "en": "We can grab this section and cut it from the App JSX file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 59.1,
          "end": 63.33,
          "en": "And in this core concepts JSX file, which we just added,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 63.33,
          "end": 66.27,
          "en": "we can export a new default function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 66.27,
          "end": 69.15,
          "en": "which should be called CoreConcepts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 69.15,
          "end": 71.673,
          "en": "And in there we can return this section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 73.38,
          "end": 76.35,
          "en": "Now of course, we just have to make sure that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 76.35,
          "end": 80.85,
          "en": "both the core concepts data and the core concept Component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 80.85,
          "end": 84.843,
          "en": "is available in this Component function and in this file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 85.74,
          "end": 88.35,
          "en": "And therefore of course we must add the respective",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 88.35,
          "end": 92.16,
          "en": "import statements and import the core concept Component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 92.16,
          "end": 95.11,
          "en": "from ./CoreConcept.JSX",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 96.53999999999999,
          "end": 100.56,
          "en": "and import the core concepts data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 100.56,
          "end": 104.82300000000001,
          "en": "from going up one level and then the data js file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 106.32,
          "end": 109.38,
          "en": "With that, this Component here should work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 109.38,
          "end": 112.22999999999999,
          "en": "and we can go back to the App Component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 112.22999999999999,
          "end": 117.22999999999999,
          "en": "And here we now should get rid of this core concepts import",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 117.39,
          "end": 121.2,
          "en": "and of this Component import here, and instead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 121.2,
          "end": 125.877,
          "en": "import the core concepts Component from",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 125.877,
          "end": 130.877,
          "en": "./Components/CoreConcepts.JSX.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 134.49,
          "end": 139.05,
          "en": "And with this import added back in the JSX code here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 139.05,
          "end": 141.963,
          "en": "we can and should output core concepts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 143.31,
          "end": 146.79,
          "en": "And with that we created our first new Component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 146.79,
          "end": 149.193,
          "en": "that has its own feature area.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 150.66,
          "end": 153.99,
          "en": "Now we can do the same for the examples here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 153.99,
          "end": 157.26,
          "en": "For that, we should grab this section with",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 157.26,
          "end": 160.15,
          "en": "the tap buttons and this tab content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 161.22,
          "end": 164.22,
          "en": "And go to this examples JSX file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 164.22,
          "end": 168.97,
          "en": "And here we also want to export the examples function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 171.39,
          "end": 173.613,
          "en": "and then return this JSX code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 175.17000000000002,
          "end": 179.22,
          "en": "But of course the JSX code is now not everything that must",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 179.22,
          "end": 181.683,
          "en": "go into this new Component function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 182.58,
          "end": 186.12,
          "en": "Instead, we now also must manage the state in here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 186.12,
          "end": 190.74,
          "en": "We must add this handle select function to this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 190.74,
          "end": 194.25,
          "en": "because at the moment we're trying to call a function here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 194.25,
          "end": 196.8,
          "en": "which is unknown in this file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 196.8,
          "end": 200.613,
          "en": "Handle select is not available here in this file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 201.69,
          "end": 205.35,
          "en": "And we also must manage this tab content variable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 205.35,
          "end": 207.96,
          "en": "in this function here now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 207.96,
          "end": 211.53,
          "en": "And therefore we can go back to the App Component file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 211.53,
          "end": 214.473,
          "en": "and there, grab this code here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 216.84,
          "end": 219.63,
          "en": "And also grab this handle select",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 219.63,
          "end": 221.74,
          "en": "and this useState code here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 222.96,
          "end": 225.51,
          "en": "so that in the end, once we cut that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 225.51,
          "end": 230.34,
          "en": "this App Component is pretty lean, which is the goal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 230.34,
          "end": 232.17000000000002,
          "en": "We wanna make it leaner",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 232.17000000000002,
          "end": 235.44,
          "en": "and we wanna outsource these different features",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 235.44,
          "end": 237.3,
          "en": "into different Components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 237.3,
          "end": 241.32,
          "en": "because especially when working in bigger React projects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 241.32,
          "end": 244.89,
          "en": "splitting your code across multiple Components like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 244.89,
          "end": 248.34,
          "en": "can make your life as a React developer easier",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 248.34,
          "end": 251.91,
          "en": "and can make working on that project easier.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 251.91,
          "end": 253.89,
          "en": "So here with all that code cut",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 253.89,
          "end": 256.77,
          "en": "we should go back to the examples Component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 256.77,
          "end": 259.95,
          "en": "and paste all that code in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 259.95,
          "end": 262.35,
          "en": "And of course now we also must make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 262.35,
          "end": 266.04,
          "en": "that useState is available in this file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 266.04,
          "end": 270.273,
          "en": "so we should import useState from React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 272.25,
          "end": 274.63,
          "en": "And we also must make sure that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 274.63,
          "end": 279.03,
          "en": "these examples constant this data here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 279.03,
          "end": 281.37,
          "en": "is available in this file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 281.37,
          "end": 285.3,
          "en": "So therefore we should also import examples",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 285.3,
          "end": 289.923,
          "en": "from going up one level and then the data js file again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 292.74,
          "end": 295.38,
          "en": "I can also get rid of this console log statement here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 295.38,
          "end": 297.48,
          "en": "because it's now in the wrong Component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 297.48,
          "end": 299.523,
          "en": "and we also don't need it anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 300.93,
          "end": 304.65,
          "en": "With that, we got these examples, JSX file finished,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 304.65,
          "end": 307.14,
          "en": "we got this Component here finished,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 307.14,
          "end": 310.11,
          "en": "and we can now go back to the App Component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 310.11,
          "end": 313.41,
          "en": "And just as before, we should get rid of those imports",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 313.41,
          "end": 315.45,
          "en": "which are not needed anymore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 315.45,
          "end": 318.573,
          "en": "because we're not using these features in this file anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 319.44,
          "end": 321.93,
          "en": "And I just saw that the tab button import",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 321.93,
          "end": 325.8,
          "en": "of course must be added in the examples JSX file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 325.8,
          "end": 327.93,
          "en": "but we'll do that in a second.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 327.93,
          "end": 330.36,
          "en": "Here in this App JSX file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 330.36,
          "end": 333.387,
          "en": "for the moment, we should just import examples from",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 333.387,
          "end": 335.46,
          "en": "./Components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 335.46,
          "end": 338.103,
          "en": "And then there examples JSX.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 339.75,
          "end": 344.7,
          "en": "So that here below core concepts, we can use examples",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 344.7,
          "end": 348.063,
          "en": "as a custom HTML element so to say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 349.83,
          "end": 353.19,
          "en": "And with that in the examples Component as mentioned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 353.19,
          "end": 356.73,
          "en": "we must make sure that this tab button is available.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 356.73,
          "end": 360.3,
          "en": "So therefore here we should also import this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 360.3,
          "end": 364.503,
          "en": "tap button Component from the tap button JSX file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 366.33,
          "end": 369.69,
          "en": "With that, if you save everything and you reload",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 369.69,
          "end": 372.63,
          "en": "you should see the same Application as before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 372.63,
          "end": 375.15,
          "en": "You should not see any errors here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 375.15,
          "end": 379.59,
          "en": "but you now see that as I click these tabs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 379.59,
          "end": 382.78,
          "en": "this text up here doesn't change anymore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 385.71,
          "end": 387.9,
          "en": "and it doesn't change anymore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 387.9,
          "end": 391.5,
          "en": "because now we're managing this selected topic state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 391.5,
          "end": 393.96,
          "en": "inside of the examples Component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 393.96,
          "end": 396.69,
          "en": "and therefore it's this Component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 396.69,
          "end": 401.46,
          "en": "that gets executed again whenever this state changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 401.46,
          "end": 403.95,
          "en": "And the App Component function on the other hand",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 403.95,
          "end": 406.74,
          "en": "is not going to be executed again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 406.74,
          "end": 409.77,
          "en": "And therefore now this header Component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
